msgid ""
"Confirm the PIN you use on this computer and choose a new master password. "
"Everything in the vault is encrypted again, and the PIN keeps working. "
"Backups made earlier still need the master password they were made with."
msgstr ""
"Bekræft computerens PIN-kode, og vælg en ny hovedadgangskode. Hele boksen "
"krypteres igen, og PIN-koden virker stadig. Ældre sikkerhedskopier kræver "
"stadig den daværende hovedadgangskode."

msgid "Confirm your master password to create a backup."
msgstr "Bekræft din hovedadgangskode for at oprette en sikkerhedskopi."

msgid "Confirm your master password to export your data."
msgstr "Bekræft din hovedadgangskode for at eksportere dine data."

