msgid ""
"Deleted entries stay in the trash for this many days, then are permanently "
"removed on next app start. Set 0 to bypass the trash."
msgstr ""
"Slettede poster bliver i papirkurven i dette antal dage og fjernes derefter "
"permanent ved næste app-start. Sæt til 0 for at omgå papirkurven."

msgid "Deleted items"
msgstr "Slettede elementer"

